*** Keywords ***
Execute L3 call
    [Documentation]                     This method gets a list of all cells on site and executes L3 call procedure using
    ...                                 each of the elements of this list. Keyword recognizes supercells and calls them in
    ...                                 appropriate way.
    ...                                 ARGS:
    ...                                 - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                 it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                 defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                 Example:
    ...                                 {
    ...                                     '827736065':
    ...                                         {
    ...                                             'throughput':
    ...                                                 {
    ...                                                     'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                     'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                 },
    ...                                             'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                         },
    ...                                 }
    ...                                 - protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...                                 - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...                                 - cells_distnames: list of configuration distnames of cells to be called;
    ...                                                    defaults to None (all cells will be called).
    ...                                 - duration: duration of data transfer in seconds; defaults to 30s
    ...                                 - attach_should_be_possible: True - expected behaviour is that attach will be possible to cell,
    ...                                                              False - expected behaviour is that attach will NOT be possible to cell
    ...                                                                     (for example when we check attach to blocked cell); defaults to True
    ...                                 - prepare_cells_to_call: True - the environment will be prepared so that only the called cell is notBarred and unblocked
    ...                                                          False - the environment will not be changed and L3 call will be performed as is; defaults to True
    ...                                 - should_fid49_be_disallowed: parameter deciding whether Fault ID 49: Cell Blocked should be removed
    ...                                                               from allowed alarms list after finished execution. Should be set to False
    ...                                                               for example in test case General_SiSo_Auto_Cell_Block_Unblock where we check
    ...                                                               if attach is not possible to cells that are blocked; defaults to True
    ...                                 - tput_verification_via_btslog: True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                             False - throughput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...                                 - ue_network_modes: mandatory parameter for SA+NSA setups, dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes
    ...                                                     e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"} possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                                     when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                                     with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                 - ues_and_cells: dict with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...                                                     can be attached e.g. {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"],
    ...                                                                           "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...                                                     defaults to ${None} which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells.
    ...                                                     when given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs, if there are more
    ...                                                     cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs
    ...                                 - ignored_cells_on_preparation: SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                                                 list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                                                 L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred

    [Arguments]                         ${throughputs}
    ...                                 ${protocol}
    ...                                 ${udp_buffer}
    ...                                 ${cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...                                 ${duration}=60s
    ...                                 ${attach_should_be_possible}=${True}
    ...                                 ${prepare_cells_to_call}=${True}
    ...                                 ${should_fid49_be_disallowed}=${True}
    ...                                 ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...                                 ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                 ${ues_and_cells}=${None}
    ...                                 ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                        hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    @{called_cells}=                    Priv Get Called Cells
    ...                                 cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                 connection=${connection}
    ${ues_and_cells_non_iot}  ${ues_and_cells_iot}
    ...                                 l3_call.extract_iot_cells_from_ues_and_cells
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                 connection=${connection}

    Alarms.Allow Alarm                  fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                 fault_id=49
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow Alarm                  fault_name=NgGnbInitPartialReset
    ...                                 fault_id=7313
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${cells_to_ues_non_iot}=            Priv Get List of Cells to UEs
    ...                                 cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells_non_iot}
    FOR    ${cell_to_ue}       IN       @{cells_to_ues_non_iot}
        call_manager.L3 Call on Selected Cells using Selected UEs
        ...                             cells_to_ues=${cell_to_ue}
        ...                             duration=${duration}
        ...                             throughputs=${throughputs}
        ...                             protocol=${protocol}
        ...                             udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
        ...                             ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
        ...                             prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
        ...                             attach_should_be_possible=${attach_should_be_possible}
        ...                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
    END
    ${called_cells}=                    Priv Remove Cells From Called Cells List
    ...                                 called_cells=${called_cells}
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells_non_iot}

    ${cells_to_ues_iot}=                Priv Get List of Cells to UEs
    ...                                 cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells_iot}
    FOR    ${cell_to_ue}       IN       @{cells_to_ues_iot}
        call_manager.L3 Call on Selected IoT Cells using Selected UEs
        ...                             cells_to_ues=${cell_to_ue}
        ...                             duration=${duration}
        ...                             prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
        ...                             attach_should_be_possible=${attach_should_be_possible}
        ...                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
    END
    ${called_cells}=                    Priv Remove Cells From Called Cells List
    ...                                 called_cells=${called_cells}
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells_iot}

    FOR    ${cell_distname}    IN      @{called_cells}
        ${is_supercell}=                admin_info_model.is_supercell
        ...                             connection=${connection}
        ...                             configuration_distname=${cell_distname}
        ${is_iot_cell}=                 l3_call.is_lte_iot_cell
        ...                             connection=${connection}
        ...                             cell_distname=${cell_distname}
        run keyword if                  ${is_supercell}
        ...     run keywords            call_manager.L3 Call on SuperCell
        ...                             called_supercell=${cell_distname}
        ...                             throughputs=${throughputs}
        ...                             protocol=${protocol}
        ...                             duration=${duration}
        ...                             udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
        ...                             attach_should_be_possible=${attach_should_be_possible}
        ...                             prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
        ...                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
        ...     AND                     Remove Values From List     ${called_cells}   ${cell_distname}
        run keyword if                  ${is_iot_cell}
        ...     run keywords            call_manager.L3 Call on IoT Cell
        ...                             called_cell=${cell_distname}
        ...                             duration=30s
        ...                             attach_should_be_possible=${attach_should_be_possible}
        ...                             prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
        ...                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
        ...     AND                     Remove Values From List     ${called_cells}   ${cell_distname}
    END

    run keyword if  ${called_cells}
    ...                                 call_manager.L3 Call
    ...                                 called_cells=${called_cells}
    ...                                 duration=${duration}
    ...                                 throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                 protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                 udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                 attach_should_be_possible=${attach_should_be_possible}
    ...                                 prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                 tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                 ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                 ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Alarms.Disallow Alarm               fault_name=NgGnbInitPartialReset
    ...                                 fault_id=7313
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    run keyword if                      ${should_fid49_be_disallowed}
    ...                                 Alarms.Disallow alarm
    ...                                 fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                 fault_id=49
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

Execute L3 Call Attach Should Not be Possible
    [Documentation]                     This method can be used to execute L3 call when attach is expected to not be
    ...                                 possible.
    ...                                 - cell_distnames: distnames of cells to which we want to ensure that attach is not possible
    ...                                 - should_fid49_be_disallowed: parameter deciding whether Fault ID 49: Cell Blocked should be removed
    ...                                                               from allowed alarms list after finished execution. Should be set to False
    ...                                                               for example in test case General_SiSo_Auto_Cell_Block_Unblock where we check
    ...                                                               if attach is not possible to cells that are blocked; defaults to True
    ...                                 - prepare_cells_to_call: True - the enviornment will be prepared so that only the called cells are notBarred and unblocked
    ...                                                          False - the enviornment will not be changed and L3 call will be performed as is; defaults to False
    ...                                 - ignored_cells_on_preparation: SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                                                 list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                                                 L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred
    [Arguments]                         ${cell_distnames}
    ...                                 ${should_fid49_be_disallowed}=${True}
    ...                                 ${prepare_cells_to_call}=${False}
    ...                                 ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                        hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow Alarm                  fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                 fault_id=49
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow Alarm                  fault_name=NgGnbInitPartialReset
    ...                                 fault_id=7313
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    FOR    ${cell_distname}    IN      @{cell_distnames}
        ${is_supercell}=                admin_info_model.is_supercell
        ...                             connection=${connection}
        ...                             configuration_distname=${cell_distname}
        run keyword if                  ${is_supercell}
        ...     run keywords            call_manager.L3 Call on SuperCell
        ...                             called_supercell=${cell_distname}
        ...                             throughputs=${None}
        ...                             attach_should_be_possible=${False}
        ...                             prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
        ...                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
        ...     AND                     Remove Values From List     ${cell_distnames}   ${cell_distname}
    END

    run keyword if  ${cell_distnames}   call_manager.L3 Call
    ...                                 called_cells=${cell_distnames}
    ...                                 duration=${None}
    ...                                 throughputs=${None}
    ...                                 attach_should_be_possible=${False}
    ...                                 prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                 protocol=${None}
    ...                                 ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Alarms.Disallow Alarm               fault_name=NgGnbInitPartialReset
    ...                                 fault_id=7313
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    run keyword if                      ${should_fid49_be_disallowed}
    ...                                 Alarms.Disallow alarm
    ...                                 fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                 fault_id=49
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}


Execute L3 Call In Background
    [Documentation]  For information about the steps, please refer to the keyword `Start L3 Call In Background` in the call_manager.robot library.
    ...              **Important: To stop L3 call in the background.**
    ...              One of the following keywords from taf.rfrl.procedures.resources.robot.L3Call.robot library should be used:
    ...              - Wait For Background L3 Call Completion And Verify Results
    ...              - Stop And Verify Background L3 Call
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - direction: direction of the data transfer, either 'UL' or 'DL'.
    ...              - duration: duration of data transfer in seconds
    ...              - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                             it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                             defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                             Example:
    ...                             {
    ...                                 '827736065':
    ...                                     {
    ...                                         'throughput':
    ...                                             {
    ...                                                 'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                 'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                             },
    ...                                          'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                      },
    ...                              }
    ...               - protocol: data transfer protocol.
    ...               - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...               - called_cell: distname of cell to be called (CONFIGURATION DISTNAME)
    ...               - cells_to_ues: pairs of configuration distnames of cells and serial numbers of
    ...                               UEs that will be attached to this cell e.g
    ...                               {"MRBTS-1/NRCELL-1": "SN1234", "MRBTS-1/LNCEL-1": "SN432"}
    ...               - prepare_cells_to_call: True - the environment will be prepared so that only the called cell is notBarred and unblocked
    ...                                        False - the environment will not be changed and L3 call will be performed as is; defaults to True
    ...               - ue_network_modes: mandatory parameter for SA+NSA setups, dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes
    ...                                   e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"} possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                   when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                   with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...               - ignored_cells_on_preparation: SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                               list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                               L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred
    [Arguments]                         ${direction}
    ...                                 ${duration}
    ...                                 ${throughputs}
    ...                                 ${protocol}
    ...                                 ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                 ${called_cell}=${None}
    ...                                 ${cells_to_ues}=${None}
    ...                                 ${prepare_cells_to_call}=${True}
    ...                                 ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                 ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}

    Alarms.Allow Alarms Before L3 Call
    call_manager.Start L3 Call In Background
    ...                                 direction=${direction}
    ...                                 duration=${duration}
    ...                                 throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                 protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                 called_cell=${called_cell}
    ...                                 cells_to_ues=${cells_to_ues}
    ...                                 udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                 prepare_cells_to_call=${prepare_cells_to_call}
    ...                                 ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                 ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}


Wait For Background L3 Call Completion And Verify Results
    [Documentation]  For information about the steps, please refer to the keyword `Verify Background L3 Call Results`
    ...              in the call_manager.robot library.
    [Arguments]                         ${called_cell}=${None}
    ...                                 ${cells_to_ues}=${None}

    call_manager.Verify Background L3 Call Results
    ...                                 called_cell=${called_cell}
    ...                                 cells_to_ues=${cells_to_ues}
    Alarms.Disallow Alarms After L3 Call


Stop And Verify Background L3 Call
    [Documentation]  For information about the steps, please refer to the keyword `Stop Background L3 Call and Verify Results`
    ...              in the call_manager.robot library.
    [Arguments]                         ${called_cell}=${None}
    ...                                 ${cells_to_ues}=${None}
    call_manager.Stop Background L3 Call and Verify Results
    ...                                 called_cell=${called_cell}
    ...                                 cells_to_ues=${cells_to_ues}
    Alarms.Disallow Alarms After L3 Call


Stop L3 Call In Background and Disallow Alarms
    [Documentation]  For information about the steps, please refer to the keyword `Stop Background L3 Call`
    ...              in the call_manager.robot library.
    [Arguments]  ${called_cell}
    ...          ${ignore_error}=${False}

    Run keyword if                      ${ignore_error}
    ...                                 Run keyword and ignore error
    ...                                 Stop Background L3 Call
    ...                                 called_cell=${called_cell}
    ...                                 ELSE
    ...                                 Stop Background L3 Call
    ...                                 called_cell=${called_cell}

    Alarms.Disallow Alarms After L3 CalL


Priv Get Called Cells
    [Arguments]                         ${cells_distnames}
    ...                                 ${connection}
    @{all_cells_distnames}=             run keyword if        ${cells_distnames}==${None}
    ...                                 admin_info_model.get_configuration_distnames_of_all_cells
    ...                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                 ELSE
    ...                                 set variable
    ...                                 ${cells_distnames}

    Robot Log Step    Removing GNCELs and WNCELs from called cells list if there are any
    @{callable_cells}=                  l3_call.remove_gsm_and_wcdma_cells_from_called_cells
    ...                                 called_cells=${all_cells_distnames}
    [Return]                            ${callable_cells}


Priv Get List of Cells to UEs
    [Arguments]                         ${cells_distnames}
    ...                                 ${ues_and_cells}
    ${cells_to_ues}=                    run keyword if    ${cells_distnames}==${None}
    ...                                 l3_call.get_list_of_unique_ues_paired_with_cells
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                 ELSE
    ...                                 run keyword
    ...                                 l3_call.get_ue_pairs_for_specific_cell_distnames
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                 cell_distnames=${cells_distnames}

    [Return]                            ${cells_to_ues}


Priv Remove Cells From Called Cells List
    [Arguments]                         ${called_cells}
    ...                                 ${ues_and_cells}
    ${selected_cells_distnames}=        l3_call.get_called_cells_from_ues_and_cells
    ...                                 ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}

    FOR    ${selected_cell_distname}   IN    @{selected_cells_distnames}
        Remove Values From List         ${called_cells}
        ...                             ${selected_cell_distname}
    END
    
    [Return]                            ${called_cells}
